WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.278
LET’S LISTEN IN TO JOE BIDEN.

00:00:05.279 --> 00:00:13.607
&gt;&gt;  HI, EVERYBODY.

00:00:13.608 --> 00:00:19.428
THE ONLY COURT PACKING GOING ON

00:00:19.462 --> 00:00:22.474
RIGHT NOW, IT’S GOING ON WITH

00:00:22.509 --> 00:00:23.677
REPUBLICANS PACKING THE COURT

00:00:23.678 --> 00:00:24.226
NOW.

00:00:24.228 --> 00:00:26.627
IT’S NOT CONSTITUTIONAL WHAT

00:00:26.628 --> 00:00:27.461
THEY’RE DOING.

00:00:27.495 --> 00:00:29.302
THEY SHOULD BE FOCUSED ON WHAT’S

00:00:29.304 --> 00:00:30.547
HAPPENING RIGHT NOW.

00:00:30.581 --> 00:00:33.712
AND THE FACT IS THAT THE ONLY

00:00:33.746 --> 00:00:36.107
PACKING GOING ON IS THIS COURT

00:00:36.141 --> 00:00:38.987
IS BEING PACKED NOW BY THE

00:00:38.988 --> 00:00:41.227
REPUBLICANS, AFTER THE VOTE IS

00:00:41.228 --> 00:00:41.842
ALREADY BEGUN.

00:00:41.876 --> 00:00:43.755
I’M GOING TO STAY FOCUSED ON IT

00:00:43.789 --> 00:00:49.934
SO WE DON’T TAKE OUR EYES OFF

00:00:49.936 --> 00:00:51.146
THE BALL HERE.

00:00:51.147 --> 00:00:52.765
[ INDISCERNIBLE ]

00:00:52.766 --> 00:00:55.419
&gt;&gt;  WELL, LOOK, BEFORE I CAME

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:58.780
OUT AGAIN TODAY TO GO SOMEWHERE,

00:00:58.781 --> 00:01:00.525
I HAD ANOTHER TEST THIS MORNING

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:01.600
AND I’M CLEAR.

00:01:01.601 --> 00:01:03.599
I THINK IT’S IMPORTANT THE

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.638
PRESIDENT MAKES SURE TWO THINGS.

00:01:06.639 --> 00:01:10.720
ONE, THAT HE IS CLEAR, HE IS NOT

00:01:10.721 --> 00:01:14.633
A SPREADER LIKE HIS -- LIKE DR.

00:01:14.634 --> 00:01:16.540
FAUCI SAID A FEW SUPER SPREADER

00:01:16.575 --> 00:01:18.044
EVENT HE HAD FOR THE SUPREME

00:01:18.079 --> 00:01:18.769
COURT ANNOUNCEMENT AND SECONDLY,

00:01:18.803 --> 00:01:20.061
I THINK IT’S IMPORTANT THAT HE

00:01:20.062 --> 00:01:22.485
MAKE IT CLEAR TO ALL THE PEOPLE

00:01:22.519 --> 00:01:23.699
THAT THEY SHOULD BE SOCIALLY

00:01:23.701 --> 00:01:23.945
DISTANCED.

00:01:23.947 --> 00:01:25.194
THEY SHOULD BE ON THE LAWN,

00:01:25.196 --> 00:01:26.756
THAT’S FINE BUT IN FACT THEY

00:01:26.791 --> 00:01:28.923
SHOULD BE SOCIALLY DISTANCED AND

00:01:28.957 --> 00:01:29.573
WEARING MASKS.

00:01:29.575 --> 00:01:30.605
THAT’S THE ONLY RESPONSIBLE

00:01:30.606 --> 00:01:31.538
THING TO DO.

00:01:31.539 --> 00:01:33.174
AND I DON’T KNOW WHAT’S GOING ON

